  "description": "More than just a tricycle, this electric rickshaw allows you to bring passengers on your rides. This electric tricycle has a passenger seat that can hold up to 300lbs of weight. The total weight capacity with both passengers and rider is 500lbs. With a 750w front hub motor there is another power to transport passengers around on any adventure. The e bike rickshaw bench seat is wide enough for either two slender adults or three children under the ages of seven. Featuring 20\" rear tires and a 24\" front tire, the center of gravity is lower in the rear making cornering easy and safe. Also, the 4\" wide tires add stability ensuring a safe ride for your precious cargo. Step-through the frame with ease, mount and dismount gracefully without fear of falling or tipping over the bike.\n\nClassic navy colored step thru alloy frame\n\n750 Watt Motor that functions either in pedal assist or full electric mode\n\n20\" Rear Wheels & 24\" Front Wheel with 4-inch wide fat tires that provide excellent roll and a cushioned, stable ride\n\nFront and rear hydraulic disc brakes for easy and prompt stopping of the e bike rickshaw\n\nUnder passenger seat supports to ensure strong support for 300lb bench seat capacity\n\nCompliant to the UL 2849 & UL 2271 Standard as Tested by ACT Labs",
